---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - FreeToolBox" description="FreeToolBox privacy policy. All tools run client-side. No data collection, no tracking, no cookies.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: May 2025</p>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>Data Processing</h2>
      <p>All FreeToolBox tools process data <strong>entirely in your browser</strong>. No data is sent to our servers or any third party. Your files, text, images and other inputs never leave your device.</p>

      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p>We do not collect, store, or process any personal data. We do not use cookies for tracking purposes. We do not require user accounts or signups.</p>

      <h2>Local Storage</h2>
      <p>Some tools use your browser's localStorage to save preferences (e.g., notepad auto-save, world clock cities). This data stays on your device and is never transmitted.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> We display advertisements through Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>.</p>
      <p><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> Our site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which may collect basic analytics (page views, country) in aggregated form. No personal data is shared.</p>

      <h2>External API Calls</h2>
      <p>A few tools (IP Address Lookup) make requests to external APIs to function. These requests are made directly from your browser, not through our servers.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>FreeToolBox does not knowingly collect data from children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
